{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"verdict\": \"both_partly\",\n  \"quotes\": [\n    \"During locomotion without FOG, Freezers showed lower beta (13–30 Hz) power (P = 0.036) and greater beta Sample Entropy (P = 0.032), than Non-Freezers, as well as greater gait asymmetry and arrhythmicity (P < 0.05 for both).\",\n    \"During the SIP task (without FOG) there was lower relative beta power in the Freezer compared to Non-Freezer groups (H(1) = 7.17, P = 0.036), which resulted in a greater attenuation of resting state beta power in Freezers (F (1, 15) = 28.37, P < 0.001).\",\n    \"Among Freezers, beta power was lower during FOG compared to during forward walking without FOG (N = 8 STNs, F(1,51) = 14.45, P < 0.001, Table 4).\",\n    \"Freezers also showed increased alpha SampEn during FOG when compared to walking without FOG (F(1, 51) = 7.67, P = 0.005).\",\n    \"Among Freezers, STN beta power was lower and alpha sample entropy was higher during FOG compared to during forward walking without FOG.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"原文明确报告了两种不同的比较，必须区分。第一种是Freezer与Non-Freezer之间的组间比较：较低beta功率发生在无FOG的运动期间，具体而言，SIP任务中Freezer的beta功率低于Non-Freezer（P=0.036）。因此，如果报告将这一组间差异本身解释为实际FOG发生期间的beta功率下降，那么报告指出的证据归属错误是成立的。第二种是Freezer自身的条件比较：原文明确报告Freezer在实际FOG期间的beta功率低于无FOG的前向行走期间（N=8 STNs，P<0.001），同时alpha Sample Entropy增加（P=0.005）。因此，指控者指出原文确实存在FOG期间beta功率下降的发现，也是正确的。不能因为第一种比较发生在无FOG期间，就否认第二种比较所证明的FOG期间beta功率下降；也不能反过来用第二种比较证明第一种组间差异发生于FOG期间。结论：报告对无FOG组间比较的定位有依据，但若据此暗示原文不存在FOG期间beta功率下降，则不完整；指控者正确指出了原文被遗漏的FOG期间beta结果，但这并不意味着无FOG组间比较可以直接解释为FOG期间的结果。因此判定为both_partly。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4f26dd93-037b-491f-9c73-0d43382f6917", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T104625328620Z", "elapsed_seconds": 24.797, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T10:46:50.134450+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5ec58d9ca44aec4965c8c90c0c6851a612bc05cbe7a494c4251c26033f8a20e8", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T104625328620Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "1a63ddeff43ae03bd7cb8bba508bb715b71594b72a97a0ab1bb66599de5f38a7"}}}
